"At the Blackpit's bottom a cursed skeleton rider re-forms from a bone to guard the well."
"The rider is upper Tier 2, far past any mortal, and does not leave the shaft."
"The slopes hide old things Bramwick threw out: a rusted sword, a cracked cauldron, coins."
"Standing in the well's air a day gives a mortal a cough of black blood and a lasting chill."
